{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“暂时还不想说”改成“还没准备好表达”，从主动暂缓表达偏成尚未准备好；也漏掉了害怕说出口会改变两人关系的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把不舍进一步解释成意识到可能失去，这一层并未明确写出；也漏掉了紧张背后害怕用力过度、破坏两人原有平衡与自在的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把紧张松开后的状态概括成平和温柔，过度抹平了原稿中的失重感、对幸福能否持续的怀疑，以及熟悉的亲近忽然像隔了一层的疏离感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了时间正在流逝、眼前的完美也无法让时间停住这一具体感受；还把身体被内心热度推动、带有情色暖意的渴望泛化成普通的渴望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把这一屏的情绪概括得偏向纯粹的低沉和内省，漏掉了想到对方也许同样喜欢自己在身边时，短暂出现的一点高兴。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把情绪主要理解成充盈的狂喜，漏掉了还想要更多却始终无法完全满足的牵扯，以及快乐到分不清想笑还是想哭的复杂性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把沉重的深层来源说成拼不出来；原稿实际上给出了害怕刚得到的亲近消失，以及想少表露心意以免受伤、却又真心想对对方好的内心矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：从亲近带来的幸福出发，经历渴望、紧张、不舍和低落，逐渐意识到幸福无法永远停留，却仍选择接纳喜欢、珍惜当下，最后沉重缓和并留下温暖余味。主要不足是淡化了部分身体性渴望、害怕失去和内心矛盾的细节，没有拼成另一段故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "725af467-4ab2-49fc-8889-0e274b9f5e5f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T090300886227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 309.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T09:08:10.133996+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd1802b35e403d2ef91a6fd72900f43fbaefc0ff076545b049311af739691572", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T090300886227Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8d23bf2d50973948abc840813f2b47b50f1b6b55164586f16a5a9cec13cd1eaa"}}}
